  "body_html": "<div class='challenge_problem_statement'><div class='msB challenge_problem_statement_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><p>Имаме масив prices, където <em>prices[i]</em> показва <strong>цената на акцията в ден i</strong>.\nЗа всеки ден искаме да разберем <strong>след колко дни цената ще се повиши</strong> (т.е. ще има по-висока стойност от текущата).</p>\n\n<p>Ако такава цена никога не се появява, запишете <strong>0</strong>.</p></div></div></div><div class='challenge_input_format'><div class='msB challenge_input_format_title'><p><strong>Input Format</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_input_format_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><p>На първия ред на стандартния вход ще получите число <strong><em>N</em></strong>, указващо броя на дните.</p>\n\n<p>На следващите <strong><em>N</em></strong> реда ще получите по едно число <strong><em>X<sub>i</sub></em></strong> <em>(0 &lt; i ≤ N)</em>, указващо цената в съответния ден.</p></div></div></div><div class='challenge_constraints'><div class='msB challenge_constraints_title'><p><strong>Constraints</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_constraints_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><ul>\n<li>1 ≤ N ≤ 100000</li>\n<li>1 ≤ X<sub>i</sub> ≤ 1000000</li>\n</ul></div></div></div><div class='challenge_output_format'><div class='msB challenge_output_format_title'><p><strong>Output Format</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_output_format_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><p>На един ред изведете <strong><em>N цели числа</em></strong>, разделени с интервал (\" \") - за всеки ден изведете след колко дни цената ще се повиши.</p>\n\n<p>Ако няма по-висока цена, изведете 0.</p></div></div></div><div class='challenge_sample_input'><div class='msB challenge_sample_input_title'><p><strong>Sample Input 0</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_sample_input_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"err\">5</span>\n<span class=\"err\">10</span>\n<span class=\"err\">9</span>\n<span class=\"err\">8</span>\n<span class=\"err\">7</span>\n<span class=\"err\">6</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div></div></div><div class='challenge_sample_output'><div class='msB challenge_sample_output_title'><p><strong>Sample Output 0</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_sample_output_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"err\">0 0 0 0 0</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div></div></div><div class='challenge_explanation'><div class='msB challenge_explanation_title'><p><strong>Explanation 0</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_explanation_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.MathJax_SVG_Display {text-align: center; margin: 1em 0em; position: relative; display: block!important; text-indent: 0; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; width: 100%}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-monospace {font-family: monospace}\n.MathJax_SVG .MJX-sans-serif {font-family: sans-serif}\n.MathJax_SVG {display: inline; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 100%; font-size-adjust: none; text-indent: 0; text-align: left; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: normal; word-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap; float: none; direction: ltr; max-width: none; max-height: none; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0}\n.MathJax_SVG * {transition: none; -webkit-transition: none; -moz-transition: none; -ms-transition: none; -o-transition: none}\n.mjx-svg-href {fill: blue; stroke: blue}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox {display: table!important}\n.MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {display: table-cell!important; width: 10000em!important; min-width: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 0}\n</style><svg style=\"display: none;\"><defs id=\"MathJax_SVG_glyphs\"></defs></svg><p>Търсим първия следващ ден, в който цената &gt; текущата.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ден 0 — цена 10</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Следващи цени: 9, 8, 7, 6 → всички са по-ниски</li>\n<li>Няма по-висока цена → 0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Ден 1 — цена 9</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Следващи цени: 8, 7, 6 → всички са по-ниски</li>\n<li>Няма по-висока цена → 0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Ден 2 — цена 8</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Следващи: 7, 6 → всички по-ниски</li>\n<li>Няма по-висока цена → 0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Ден 3 — цена 7</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Следващ ден = 6 → по-ниска</li>\n<li>Няма по-висока цена → 0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Ден 4 — цена 6</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Няма следващи дни → 0</li>\n</ul></div></div></div><div class='challenge_sample_input'><div class='msB challenge_sample_input_title'><p><strong>Sample Input 1</strong></p></div><div class='msB challenge_sample_input_body'><div class='hackdown-content'><style id=\"MathJax_SVG_styles\">.